        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>archived</Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 214, width: 1040, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        异常分支：待审核 → 已驳回（rejected）→ 回到草稿，驳回必须填写原因；已发布课程下架后移出「可绑定课程清单」，历史学习记录保留。
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 272, width: 700, height: 2, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 284, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>
        发布前置条件与业务规则
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 318, width: 700, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 11, paddingBottom: 11, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 16, color: '#3D7BD9' }}>①</Text>
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                前置校验：标题、分类、简介、封面齐全，且至少 1 个章节、1 个已上传成功的课时
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 11, paddingBottom: 11, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 16, color: '#3D7BD9' }}>②</Text>
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                涉密自查：审核台设置涉密自查项，涉警敏感内容按校方规定处理后方可发布
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 11, paddingBottom: 11, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 16, color: '#3D7BD9' }}>③</Text>
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                越权隔离：教师只能管理本人创建且处于草稿 / 驳回态的课程，不能自审自发
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 11, paddingBottom: 11, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 34, fontSize: 16, color: '#3D7BD9' }}>④</Text>
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                全程留痕：审核、发布、下架、归档四个动作写入审计日志，保留 3 年
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 800, top: 272, width: 420, height: 336, background: '#12304F', padding: 28, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.72)', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
            内容质量指标
